                                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>.
airs:ApplicationProcess a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                        rdfs:comment """ApplicationProcess describes the steps taken to apply for or access the service; also known as the 'intake process'. For example, \"Call for an appointment\" or \"Walk in only\"."""@en;
                        rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> xsd:string ; 
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> ; 
                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>.
