airs:requiresDocument a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
airs:requiresFamily a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
airs:requiresGender a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                    rdfs:comment "Information about any age or gender related requirements or inclusions for a particular service at a particular location."@en.
airs:requiresGeneralEligibility a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
                                rdfs:comment "General eligibility is a text area to list any eligibility requirements for participation or services. This can include any exclusions, both negative and positive requirements (i.e. must have/ can't have are all requirements)"@en.
airs:requiresIncome a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
airs:requiresMaximumAge a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                        rdfs:subPropertyOf airs:requiresGender.
airs:requiresMinimumAge a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                        rdfs:subPropertyOf airs:requiresGender.
airs:requiresResidency a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
airs:seasonal a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
airs:servesGeographicArea a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>,
                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
airs:status a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
airs:structuresFees a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
airs:taxonomyCode a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
airs:taxonomyTerm a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
airs:transportationServicesAccess a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
                                  rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#topDataProperty>.
airs:yearIncorporated a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
